      "text": "1. ingest data from (SAP, CRM, )\n2. Classify & label at ingestion time\n    PII, PHI, PCI tags.\n3. Internal, restricted, public, \n     confidential (sensitivity labels)\n4. Tenant/BU/Region/Owner/Retention",
